# FPM active mirror(s)
#
# Used by default for -upd and -i. 'fpm -ms' picks a mirror from the full
# pool (candidates.list) and rewrites THIS file to a single entry.
#
# All URLs below were verified end-to-end:
#   Arch        https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/   -> 15266 packages
#   Alpine      https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/ -> 23035 packages
#   Debian      https://deb.debian.org/debian/     -> 63440 packages
#   Fedora/RPM  https://mirror.fcix.net/fedora/    -> 76354 packages

# Arch Linux (primary mirror)
https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/

# Alpine Linux
https://dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org/alpine/

# Debian
https://deb.debian.org/debian/

# Fedora Linux (RPM format)
https://mirror.fcix.net/fedora/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reserved safety net. This URL is ALWAYS attempted (hardcoded in the binary)
# when every mirror above fails. It is not stored here: it cannot be removed.
#   https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------